 "notes": [
  "Qty 53 as published: the Characters (19) section breaks off after 12 cards ('Derek'), so the list is 7 short of the headers' 60. The strategy explains Olander Brit and Major Haash'n and mentions Elyhek Rue, probably among the missing characters, but they are not added.",
  "The strategy says he normally starts Wise Advice, Squadron Assignments and usually Insurrection (Draw Their Fire instead vs Court); several Effects, so no single starting Effect is set.",
  "Posted 'Derek' dested Derek 'Hobbie' Klivian (the only Derek); 'Threepio' Threepio (Endor); 'Han with Blaster' Han With Heavy Blaster Pistol; 'Liea with Rifle' Leia With Blaster Rifle; 'Wedge Antilles, Red Squad Leader' Wedge Antilles, Red Squadron Leader; 'Red 7' the Special Edition starship Red 7 (not Red Squadron 7).",
  "Posted 'Push on Us' dested What're You Tryin' To Push On Us?; 'Star Destroyer' the Light Interrupt Star Destroyer!; 'Nabrun Lieds' Nabrun Leids; 'Nebulan B Frigate' Nebulon-B Frigate; 'Chandrilla' Chandrila; 'Kiffix' Kiffex; 'Chirpa's Hut' Endor: Chief Chirpa's Hut; 'Hoth War Room' Hoth: Echo Command Center (War Room); Wise Advice is the Special Edition Effect (no Defensive Shields yet)."
